# Doc/Task Attach Picker Sheet

::summary
One sheet, two modes — the title reads "Share a doc" / "Share a task" per the attach-menu item used. Live search filters the list; a row tap attaches into the composer and closes the sheet.
::

::modal[name=doc-task-picker title="Share a doc" width=360 placement=centered dismissible=true]

:::search[name=picker-search placeholder="Search…" action=filterPickerItems]
:::

:::row[icon=doc action=attachDocToThread href=#]
Talent
Updated Aug 02
:::

:::row[icon=doc action=attachDocToThread href=#]
tidepool — Spec
Updated Aug 02
:::

:::row[icon=doc action=attachDocToThread href=#]
Surfspace Todo Items
Updated Aug 02
:::

::

## Task mode

Same sheet — ONE `::modal[name=doc-task-picker]` definition (above); the entry action swaps the title to "Share a task" and the rows swap kind and action (`attachTaskToThread`). Task-mode row treatment:

::row[icon=task action=attachTaskToThread href=#]
Verify DMARC policy
To Do · Urgent
::

::row[icon=task action=attachTaskToThread href=#]
Play RTDN returns 503 — server secrets unset
Research · High
::

Top-right ✕ per dismiss canon. Live filtering (debounced) is state layer; the rows above document task mode of the SAME sheet — this file defines exactly one modal.

At small width (≤ 767px, R-C ruling 08-10) the sheet goes edge-to-edge with 10px side insets and auto width; the wide placement declared on the block is unchanged.
